.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.\" Copyright (c) 2026 Giacomo Picchiarelli and GlyphaStore contributors
.Dd @MAN_DATE@
.Dt GLYPHASTORED 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm glyphastored
.Nd GlyphaStore network daemon
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar options
.Nm
.Fl Fl help
.Nm
.Fl Fl version
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the GlyphaStore network process around an embedded Store.
For version
.Sy @PROJECT_VERSION@
it runs only the paired Reader/Writer shard-pair runtime: each owner shard has
one Reader/Reactor and one serial Writer connected by SPSC lanes.
.Pp
Settings resolve as
.Sy defaults < deployment profile < config file < environment < CLI .
Unknown keys, unknown profile names, empty values, duplicate keys in one file,
and conflicting
.Cm --reuse-port
/
.Cm --no-reuse-port
fail closed before the process listens.
.Pp
.Dv SIGINT
and
.Dv SIGTERM
request an orderly stop: stop accepting, drain connections and admitted durable
mutations (bounded by
.Fl Fl shutdown-drain-ms ) ,
then close the Store.
Queued mutations that have not entered Store execution when the drain deadline
expires complete as unavailable; in-flight Store work is never cancelled.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Ss General
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl Fl help
Show help and exit 0.
.It Fl V , Fl Fl version
Show version and exit 0.
.It Fl Fl config Ar PATH
Load settings from
.Ar PATH
(file cannot set
.Cm config , help ,
or
.Cm version ) .
.It Fl Fl profile Ar NAME
Apply a deployment preset:
.Cm dev
(volatile, no background maintenance),
.Cm embedded
(durable-periodic with constrained caps), or
.Cm production
(durable-periodic with background maintenance; still requires
.Fl Fl data-dir ) .
Also
.Ev GLYPHASTORE_PROFILE .
.It Fl Fl dump-config
Print the resolved effective settings
.Pq GlyphaStore/config ASCII key=value
after the same validation used before listen, then exit without binding or
opening a Store.
CLI-only.
.It Fl q , Fl Fl quiet
Suppress normal startup/shutdown messages (never suppresses errors).
.It Fl Fl log-format Ar FORMAT
.Cm human
(default) or
.Cm json
(JSON-lines lifecycle events on stderr).
.El
.Ss Listen and topology
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl b Ar IPv4 , Fl Fl bind Ar IPv4
Bind address (default
.Cm 127.0.0.1 ) .
Non-loopback cleartext has no authentication — trusted networks only.
.It Fl p Ar PORT , Fl Fl port Ar PORT
Listen port; 0 selects ephemeral (default 7379).
.It Fl Fl shard-pairs Ar COUNT
Number of Reader/Writer shard pairs (default 1).
.It Fl w Ar COUNT , Fl Fl workers Ar COUNT
Deprecated 0.1.x alias for
.Fl Fl shard-pairs .
Naming both flags together fails closed.
Wire and Manifest still report
.Cm worker_count
as this pair count.
.It Fl Fl max-connections Ar COUNT
Concurrent connection limit (default 4096).
.It Fl Fl handoff-capacity Ar COUNT
Per-connection handoff queue bound (default 4096).
.It Fl Fl event-batch-size Ar COUNT
Readiness events per wait (default 256).
.It Fl Fl max-input-bytes Ar BYTES
Buffered input per connection (default 4MiB).
.It Fl Fl max-output-bytes Ar BYTES
Buffered output per connection (default 4MiB).
.It Fl Fl durable-mutation-queue-capacity Ar COUNT
Admitted mutations per ShardPair (default 256).
.It Fl Fl durable-mutation-queue-bytes Ar BYTES
Owned mutation bytes per ShardPair (default 16MiB).
.It Fl Fl durable-mutation-queue-wait-ms Ar MS
Expire queued mutations after this wait; 0 disables (default 0).
.It Fl Fl shutdown-drain-ms Ar MS
Bound drain after stop (default 30000; 0 unbounded).
.It Fl Fl reuse-port
Enable per-executor
.Dv SO_REUSEPORT
where supported.
.It Fl Fl no-reuse-port
Disable
.Dv SO_REUSEPORT .
Mutually exclusive with
.Fl Fl reuse-port .
.It Fl Fl executor-affinity
Request executor CPU affinity where supported (strict on Linux, advisory on
macOS).
.It Fl Fl unix-socket Ar PATH
Also listen on
.Dv AF_UNIX
.Ar PATH
(owner-only socket mode).
.It Fl Fl unix-peercred
Map UDS peers to authz principal
.Cm unix:uid=N
via
.Dv SO_PEERCRED / getpeereid
(requires
.Fl Fl unix-socket ;
not a TLS replacement).
.El
.Ss Storage and maintenance
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl Fl storage-mode Ar MODE
.Cm volatile ,
.Cm durable-sync ,
.Cm durable-periodic ,
or
.Cm durable-group .
.It Fl Fl data-dir Ar PATH
Durable v1 data directory (required for durable modes).
.It Fl Fl open-mode Ar MODE
.Cm open-or-create
(default),
.Cm create-new ,
or
.Cm open-existing .
.It Fl Fl maintenance-mode Ar MODE
.Cm cooperative ,
.Cm background
(default), or
.Cm disabled .
.It Fl Fl maintenance-max-copy-bytes-per-cycle Ar BYTES
Limit one normal compaction (default 128MiB; 0 disables).
.It Fl Fl maintenance-max-copy-bytes-per-sec Ar BYTES
Normal-mode copy budget per second (default 0=unlimited).
.It Fl Fl maintenance-max-cpu-ms-per-window Ar MS
Normal-mode wall-time budget per second (default 0=unlimited).
.It Fl Fl maintenance-suspend-on-p99-latency-ms Ar MS
Suspend normal compaction on foreground mutation p99 (default 0=disabled).
.It Fl Fl maintenance-suspend-on-p99-min-samples Ar COUNT
Samples required before p99 suspension (default 32).
.It Fl Fl maintenance-max-latency-deferral-ms Ar MS
Admit one reclaim after continuous latency deferral (default 30000).
.It Fl Fl maintenance-unread-ttl-pressure-probe Ar BOOL
Probe unread expired sealed puts under pressure/emergency (default true).
.It Fl Fl maintenance-unread-ttl-normal-scheduling Ar BOOL
Include unread expired sealed puts in normal dead-byte threshold (default false).
.It Fl Fl sync-interval-ms Ar MS
Durable-periodic flush interval (default 1000).
.It Fl Fl group-max-records Ar COUNT
Strict-group / periodic batch record limit.
.It Fl Fl group-max-bytes Ar BYTES
Strict-group / periodic batch byte limit.
.It Fl Fl group-max-wait-ms Ar MS
Strict-group / periodic batch close wait.
.It Fl Fl max-store-bytes Ar BYTES
Cap durable Segment bytes (default 8GiB).
.It Fl Fl reserved-free-bytes Ar BYTES
Keep this much free space unused (default 256MiB).
.It Fl Fl max-segments Ar COUNT
Cap durable Segment count (default 127).
.It Fl Fl max-hot-cache-bytes Ar BYTES
Hot-cache cap across Workers (default 256MiB; 0 disables).
.It Fl Fl max-hot-cache-value-bytes Ar BYTES
Reject hot-cache admission above this size (default 64KiB).
.It Fl Fl disable-hot-cache
Disable hot-cache admission.
.It Fl Fl max-temporary-compaction-bytes Ar BYTES
Cap temporary compaction peak (default 1GiB).
.El
.Ss TLS and authorization
Requires a build with LibreSSL/OpenSSL
.Pq GLYPHASTORE_ENABLE_TLS .
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl Fl tls-cert Ar PATH
PEM certificate chain for TLS 1.3 (requires
.Fl Fl tls-key ) .
.It Fl Fl tls-key Ar PATH
PEM private key (requires
.Fl Fl tls-cert ) .
.It Fl Fl tls-client-ca Ar PATH
PEM CA for client certificates (enables mTLS).
.It Fl Fl tls-crl Ar PATH
PEM CRL for mTLS revocation (fail closed; requires
.Fl Fl tls-client-ca ) .
.It Fl Fl tls-ocsp-fail-closed
Require fail-closed revocation via
.Fl Fl tls-crl
(live AIA OCSP HTTP unsupported).
.It Fl Fl tls-port Ar PORT
TLS on
.Ar PORT
while
.Fl Fl port
stays cleartext (incompatible with
.Fl Fl secure-profile ) .
Without
.Fl Fl tls-port ,
TLS makes
.Fl Fl port
TLS-only.
.It Fl Fl authz-map Ar PATH
Static principal capability map (read/write/admin; optional prefix=; default-deny).
.It Fl Fl secure-profile
Fail-closed secure profile: require TLS+mTLS+authz-map; refuse dual cleartext
.Fl Fl tls-port ;
apply Phase 5 abuse-limit defaults (explicit 0 refused); with
.Fl Fl unix-socket
also require
.Fl Fl unix-peercred ;
randomize Index mix and Worker routing seeds unless overridden.
.It Fl Fl index-hash-seed Ar U64
Process-lifetime Index mix seed (ADR 0026).
.It Fl Fl worker-hash-seed Ar U64
Worker ownership SipHash-2-4 seed (ADR 0030); persists in Manifest for durable
Stores.
.El
.Ss Abuse controls
Distinct from maintenance rate budgets. Zero disables each limit (trusted
cleartext default).
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl Fl max-accepts-per-sec Ar COUNT
Accepted connections/handshakes per second.
.It Fl Fl idle-timeout-ms Ar MS
Close idle connections after this wait.
.It Fl Fl request-timeout-ms Ar MS
Bound partial-frame assembly and in-flight response wait.
Store mutations already executing are not cancelled.
.It Fl Fl connection-max-requests-per-sec Ar COUNT
Per-connection request admission.
.It Fl Fl principal-max-requests-per-sec Ar COUNT
Per-principal request admission.
.It Fl Fl principal-max-bytes-per-sec Ar BYTES
Per-principal request+response byte budget.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
File keys are long option names without
.Cm --
.Pq e.g. Cm port = 7379 .
Environment variables use
.Ev GLYPHASTORE_
plus the long name in
.Dv SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE
.Pq e.g. Ev GLYPHASTORE_PORT , Ev GLYPHASTORE_DATA_DIR .
Boolean flags accept
.Cm true/false , yes/no , on/off ,
or
.Cm 1/0 .
.Sh WIRE PROBES
Wire-protocol
.Cm HEALTH
(opcode 7) and
.Cm READY
(opcode 8) are accepted before
.Cm INIT/BIND_WORKER .
.Cm STATS
(opcode 9) returns a bounded ASCII admin report while live.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
Success
.Pq including help/version/dump-config .
.It 1
Runtime, configuration, or operating-system failure.
.It 2
Invalid command-line usage.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
glyphastored --bind 127.0.0.1 --port 7379 --shard-pairs 4
glyphastored --config /etc/glyphastore/daemon.conf
glyphastored --profile embedded --data-dir /var/lib/glyphastore --dump-config
glyphastored --secure-profile --bind 127.0.0.1 --port 7379 \e
  --tls-cert ... --tls-key ... --tls-client-ca ... --authz-map ...
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr glyphastore 7 ,
.Xr glyphastore_verify_store 1 ,
.Xr glyphastore_backup_store 1
.Pp
Source docs:
.Pa docs/cli.md ,
.Pa docs/operations/durable-tcp-daemon.md .
.Sh AUTHORS
GlyphaStore contributors.
